      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:timothy.discourses.on_abbaton:22-54",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ϩⲛⲟⲩϣⲡⲛϣⲱⲡ ϩⲛⲟⲩⲣⲓⲕⲉ ⲛⲃⲁⲗ ϩⲛⲧϩⲁⲏ ⲛⲥⲁⲗⲡⲓⲅⲝ ϥⲛⲁ**ⲥⲁⲗⲡⲓⲍⲉ** ⲅⲁⲣ ⲛⲧⲉⲛⲉⲧⲙⲟⲟⲩⲧ ⲧⲱⲟⲩⲛ ⲉⲩⲟ ⲛⲁⲧⲧⲁⲕⲟ ⲁⲩⲱ ⲁⲛⲟⲛ ⲧⲛⲛⲁϣⲓⲃⲉ .",
      "english": "in a moment, in the twinkling of an eye, at the last trumpet. For the trumpet will sound, and the dead will be raised incorruptible, and we will be changed.",
      "source": "46_1 Corinthians_15",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.1cor.sahidica:15",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
